  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Partnerships Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Partnerships Program is to strengthen the higher education system to address Egypts development priorities. Through partnerships with the Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research  (MOHESR), Egyptian Higher Education Institutions (HEIS), and the private sector, the partnerships activity will  accelerate the MOHESRs vision to transform Egypts public HEIS into world-class, market-relevant centers of learning that prepare and connect Egyptian students to the workforce.</narrative>
  </description>
